  "body": "**Stacked on #4218** (the turning slice). The two slices change the same rows of the raw-call guard. Until #4218 merges, this diff also shows its commit (42ca7bfc5). The commit of this PR is 9886fef31. After #4218 merges, I merge `main` into this branch.\n\n## What changed\n\nThe multi-axis page family of #1122 draws through the form seam.\n\n- The family is `multiaxis_page.rs`, `rotary_page.rs` and `multiaxis_deburr_page.rs`. The setup rotary and axis pick pages are in the setup and fixtures family. `machine_axis_chain.rs` is in the tools and machine family.\n- On `main` the family had one raw call: the read-only \"Always on\" value of the multi-axis deburr page's \"Shank and holder guard\" row (`ui.label`). It now uses `list_row`, the read-only text of the form seam. It paints the same text.\n- The raw-call guard (`layout/form_seam_tests.rs`) gets a `multi-axis` family at 0, and `form_seam_guard_covers_only_the_migrated_families` pins its three files.\n- Decision record: `docs/decisions/1122-form-seam-multiaxis.md`.\n\nBehaviour-neutral. No new test and no new test binary.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `egui_app::layout::form_seam_tests::pages_do_not_add_raw_egui_calls_outside_the_form_seam`: the multi-axis family has 0 raw calls.\n- `egui_app::layout::form_seam_tests::form_seam_guard_covers_only_the_migrated_families`: holes, turning and multi-axis, each at 0, with their files.\n- `egui_app::tests::ma_deburr_page::the_passes_tab_shows_the_shank_guard_as_always_on_with_no_switch`: the row still paints \"Always on\".\n- Also green: the other `form_seam_tests` and `ma_deburr_page` tests, and the `multiaxis` and `rotary` tests of the `camcraft-ui` lib (20 in all).\n\n## Screenshots\n\nThe Properties pane on the Multi-Axis Deburr Passes tab, from the off-screen renderer (`egui_kittest` with the headless wgpu device) at 1600 x 1100, cropped to the pane. A pixel comparison of the full frames gives 0 different pixels. The images are on the images-only `pr-screenshots` branch of the fork.\n\n| Before (42ca7bfc5, the turning slice) | After (9886fef31) |\n|---|---|\n| ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1122-multiaxis/before-ma-deburr-passes.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1122-multiaxis/after-ma-deburr-passes.png) |\n\n## Gates\n\nOn 9886fef31:\n\n- Quick gate (`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`): 10 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled (2.6 min). It includes `ui suites: lib`.\n- `cargo clippy --no-deps --all-targets -p camcraft-ui -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- Heavy lanes: the diff reaches none.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No check by hand in the GUI window.\n\nChangelog: none (no behaviour change).\n\nRefs #1122\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
